#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p s52(3)` EQUALS `Dec`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p s28(1)` EQUALS `Dec`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p trans 285` EQUALS `Dec`
-- s 2(2): part 2 not yet in force; part 3; ss 56 to 59; part 6; schedule 1.
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p s29` EQUALS `Jul`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p s28(2)` EQUALS `Jul`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p trans other` EQUALS `Jul`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p sch1` EQUALS `Jul`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p cc` EQUALS `Jul`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p pt6` EQUALS `Jul`
-- s 2(3).
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p pt11` EQUALS `ART`
-- not named: ss 1 and 2; part 4 heading, ss 55 and 59A ("56 to 59" stops at 59); parts 5, 6A, 7, 8, 9, 9A, 10.
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p s1-2` EQUALS `unnamed`
#ASSERT `When does this change commence under s 2` `p cc other` EQUALS `unnamed`
